# bail-processing-algorithms

## Bond Status Processing Components

### Bond Format Normalization
The system standardizes bail amounts and conditions across multiple jurisdictions, implementing:
- Automatic currency normalization for bond amounts
- Condition mapping to standardized codes
- Status transition validation based on bond type

### Eligibility Rule Engine
Determines bail eligibility based on:
- Case classification and severity
- Prior compliance history 
- Geographic restrictions
- Real-time verification against law enforcement databases

### Fast-path Bond Status Lookup
Implements cached lookups for high-volume status checks:
- Bond reference number validation
- Eligibility status caching with TTL
- Multi-jurisdiction status aggregation
- Status change notification triggers

